# Golden G-M5-1: the second WOW — the chord sequence drives the band.
# | C | F | looped feeds the arranger: drums fixed on ch10, bass and comp
# follow the harmony (NTT). Bar 3 switches to varB (quantized), bar 4 is
# fillA (one-shot, returns), then ending1 stops the transport by itself.
key C major
port open out virt as synth
chord out synth:4
style load basic
style route drums synth:10
style route bass synth:2
style route chord1 synth:3
seq new verse
seq add C 1bar
seq add F 1bar
seq loop on
seq play
transport start
@7670  style section varB
@11510 style section fillA
@15350 style section ending1
advance 23040
quit
